{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1442334-does-anyone-still-play-2e","id":1442334,"title":"does anyone still play 2e?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-04-01T16:45:49-07:00","id":1442334,"title":"does anyone still play 2e?","content":"I want to play exalted 2e but have found few players and almost no dms who will run it. is there a group who could take a new player (me) or who want to start up a game (i could be convinced to run)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26743-lesley-dm","name":"Lesley (dm)","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-01T16:56:49-07:00","id":1442336,"title":"","content":"I play 2.5. I know of 5 steady Play By Post games, if it interests you.<br /> <br /> Feel free to PM me, if you like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-01T20:03:40-07:00","id":1442356,"title":"","content":"Be the storyteller you want to see in the world. <br /> <br /> That said, I prefer 3rd Edition. Good luck!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https:/